{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And El Shaddai.</b> He who has sufficiency (די) in his divinity for all creatures, may he bless you. R[abbi] A[kiva?] said: a deed's validity is only through its seals; therefore he blessed him, after the blessing of 'ויתן לך,' once more on his own initiative — this is the blessing of <b>and El Shaddai may he bless you</b>; it is the validation of the deed, so that they should not say in fraud: Jacob took the blessings."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:24.878622786Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}